(7464714, 1184507, 63218, '<td valign="top">I''m enjoying the lovely clear light in this. Likewise, I love the texture--better than hair, or a head-scarf, or a hat--it''s like she has her head in the clouds. Also I like the way the Golden Girl is making eye contact with the camera. Well done!</td>', 'I''m enjoying the lovely clear light in this. Likewise, I love the texture--better than hair, or a head-scarf, or a hat--it''s like she has her head in the clouds. Also I like the way the Golden Girl is making eye contact with the camera. Well done!', '2016-07-17 11:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7464715, 1184387, 63218, '<td valign="top">They have such pretty feathers, which you captured nicely. They do indeed love peanuts, Nice DOF on this, too.</td>', 'They have such pretty feathers, which you captured nicely. They do indeed love peanuts, Nice DOF on this, too.', '2016-07-17 11:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
