(7464718, 1184439, 63218, '<td valign="top">I like looking at this from afar. There''s a fascinating evocation of moving water that is rewarding to look at. Up closer, it looses some of its magic &amp; becomes more photographic in nature.</td>', 'I like looking at this from afar. There''s a fascinating evocation of moving water that is rewarding to look at. Up closer, it looses some of its magic & becomes more photographic in nature.', '2016-07-17 12:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
