(7465474, 1184355, 142591, '<td valign="top">For my first entry in 3 yrs I''m very happy with my first 6.Must confess though that in my haste to enter I got an F in geography. The location was actually Meelup which is in Dunsborough(West Aus),not Myalup.That''s embarrassing. Lights on the horizon are actually from Busselton up the coast a bit, not lightning.Extremely wet weekend but thought I''d head out to see if I could get anything. Glad I did!</td>', 'For my first entry in 3 yrs I''m very happy with my first 6.Must confess though that in my haste to enter I got an F in geography. The location was actually Meelup which is in Dunsborough(West Aus),not Myalup.That''s embarrassing. Lights on the horizon are actually from Busselton up the coast a bit, not lightning.Extremely wet weekend but thought I''d head out to see if I could get anything. Glad I did!', '2016-07-23 05:34:52.000000', NULL, 0),
