(7465529, 1184368, 63218, '<td valign="top">I came back to read your Notes because I was wondering about the distortion...big smile when I discovered it was a corner of a flip''n''blend. It''s a process that give seemingly endless opportunity for new ideas. I know I never get bored with it. Anyway--good work Robert!</td>', 'I came back to read your Notes because I was wondering about the distortion...big smile when I discovered it was a corner of a flip''n''blend. It''s a process that give seemingly endless opportunity for new ideas. I know I never get bored with it. Anyway--good work Robert!', '2016-07-23 11:11:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(7465530, 1184510, 63218, '<td valign="top">ha! I couldn''t help but remember how tricky those heels can be. Looks like a fun shoot.</td>', 'ha! I couldn''t help but remember how tricky those heels can be. Looks like a fun shoot.', '2016-07-23 11:23:29.000000', NULL, 0),
