(7465778, 1184472, 135558, '<td valign="top">Nice one Neat and thanks for your comment on mine. Only look at yours I can see it says Swan Valley - great feel and emotion to this one. Nice.</td>', 'Nice one Neat and thanks for your comment on mine. Only look at yours I can see it says Swan Valley - great feel and emotion to this one. Nice.', '2016-07-25 08:08:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7465804, 1184368, 10785, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the behind the scenes peek in your comments and the <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1329367&amp;page=1#7465486" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">outtakes thread</a>. This is really cool and reminds me of a clip from a sci-fi movie like Avatar or possibly something from the Ewok Village in Star Wars. I can totally see a Stormtrooper on a speeder bike breaking through the force field!</td>', 'Thanks for the behind the scenes peek in your comments and the outtakes thread. This is really cool and reminds me of a clip from a sci-fi movie like Avatar or possibly something from the Ewok Village in Star Wars. I can totally see a Stormtrooper on a speeder bike breaking through the force field!', '2016-07-25 09:54:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(7465839, 1184462, 113156, '<td valign="top">What a dandy danse, superb.</td>', 'What a dandy danse, superb.', '2016-07-25 14:23:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7472926, 1183791, 182284, '<td valign="top">You amaze me. You are so talented. Congratulations!</td>', 'You amaze me. You are so talented. Congratulations!', '2016-09-07 01:24:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(7475272, 1184509, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Waitingsilence:</b></div><hr/><i> Thanks for all the comments and votes :)<br/> <br/>This was definitely a last minute entry, I had something else in mind but it was too complex to achieve with the little time I had, so I assembled this star trail.<br/> <br/>I''m glad you appreciated it, what I wanted to share with this was exactly a sense of abstract and psychedelic! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/> You sure achieved that look! Well done.</td>', 'Originally posted by Waitingsilence: Thanks for all the comments and votes :) This was definitely a last minute entry, I had something else in mind but it was too complex to achieve with the little time I had, so I assembled this star trail. I''m glad you appreciated it, what I wanted to share with this was exactly a sense of abstract and psychedelic!    You sure achieved that look! Well done.', '2016-09-22 21:28:33.000000', NULL, 0),
