(7600546, 1184462, 61651, '<td valign="top">is this at Grounds for Sculpture in NJ? I went there once for a DPC GTG with a few other members, and saw this there - just dug out mine: <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=775077" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/61651/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_775077.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/61651/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_775077.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/61651/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_775077.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>this b&amp;w treatment lends a more foreboding feel</td>', 'is this at Grounds for Sculpture in NJ? I went there once for a DPC GTG with a few other members, and saw this there - just dug out mine:   this b&w treatment lends a more foreboding feel', '2018-11-03 23:36:38.000000', NULL, 0);
